  "title": "RADIO: Outcast",
  "subtitle": "Discos, Lassos, and Lies",
  "description": "A queer and BIPOC led audio drama where disco meets desert shootouts. When Helix, the Messenger Goddess of Sound, gets yanked from 1987 and sent to 1887 by the Goddess of Time after a nasty breakup, she must forge an alliance with two humans: Jesse, a young black cowboy seeking justice after his father's murder, and Charles, a gay conman with a mysterious past. This fantasy-western follows the unlikely trio’s adventures across treacherous deserts, roller rinks, cult strongholds, showboats, and burgeoning cities. Support us on Patreon . Grab the merch . Visit us at https://www.radiooutcast.com/ Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
